Description: Clang/LLVM 19 for rootless iOS (Swift 6.1 companion)
 Versioned install under /var/jb/usr/lib/llvm-19 with clang-19 on PATH.
 Patched lld signs after write; clang re-signs after dsymutil
 and when not using lld. CLANG_NO_LDID / LLD_NO_LDID skip.
 (for Go/Rust/Nim final signing). CLANG_LDID_ENTITLEMENTS sets the plist.
 Built on Mac from Apple llvm-project @ Swift 6.1.x; packaged here.
 Does not replace Procursus clang-16. Install swift-6.1 for Swift.
